| **US-02** | As a **Customer**, I want to optionally add a single bank account so that I can pay by bank transfer. | **US-02-AC01** (condition) – At most one BankAccount may be linked to a Customer. <br> **US-02-AC02** (condition) – The bank account fields (accountNumber, routingNumber) are mandatory when a BankAccount is provided. <br> **US-02-AC03** (given_when_then) – Given a Customer with no BankAccount, When the Customer adds a bank account, Then the account is stored and linked to the Customer. |
